# Jade Monolith: "{1}: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to target creature this turn, that source deals
# that damage to you instead" (CR 609.7a, 614.1a, 614.9). Bot1 blocks Bot2's Fencing Ace (1/1 double strike) with its Grizzly
# Bears, pays exactly {1} (the Island, the pool left empty) to target the Bears, and chooses the Ace as the source. The Ace's
# first-strike damage to the Bears is the next time: the Ace deals that 1 damage to Bot1, the ability's controller, instead
# of the Bears. The effect is then used up, so the regular-damage hit is dealt to the Bears: Bot1 19, the Bears 1 damage.

